From ecd94a90e9e6911730885a1584e2e242db53431e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Muhomor <muhomor.dmitry@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 May 2024 19:37:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add duress PIN and password for lemonadep

Port GrapheneOS platform_frameworks_base commit 0170b3e9d957a67a7dad69cbe71aeaea8fc570d3 to LineageOS 24.0.

Run duress checks after a real protector rejection, preserving precedence when the normal credential succeeds or cannot be verified. Require a fresh owner credential for management. Exclude eSIM erase for the LE2127 and request low-level shutdown immediately after deleteSecrets.
